@MilosKozak  There is special icon with `x`-mark that were used to show `disabled` autosens. Why it is not used anymore? The design has changed?
All the way till latest it were showing `X` without value for disabled autosens and this icon with percentage value only when autosens is enabled (ie USED). Whats the point of showing disabled functionality on main screen?
And the condition in code states that this icon must be used when `isAutosensModeEnabled() == true` - ie autosens IS enabled. Second part of condition is simply errorneus and it makes no sense.
